<item><title>Tunisia closes Jebel Jelloud road for two nights of south-entry works</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-closes-jebel-jelloud-road-for-two-nights-of-south-671c72/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-closes-jebel-jelloud-road-for-two-nights-of-south-671c72/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The Ministry of Equipment and Housing says a section of national road 1 (RN1) will shut from 22:00 to 05:00 on 27 and 28 November, with detours for both directions.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:13:08 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>EU-backed programme mobilises €52.3 million for 396 Tunisian businesses</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/eu-backed-programme-mobilises-52-3-million-for-396-tunisian-c0094d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/eu-backed-programme-mobilises-52-3-million-for-396-tunisian-c0094d/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The €170 million Tunisia Economic Recovery programme has reached companies in 23 governorates, with financing still open to applicants.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:07:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/eu-backed-programme-mobilises-52-3-million-for-396-tunisian-c0094d/share.jpg" length="42183" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/eu-backed-programme-mobilises-52-3-million-for-396-tunisian-c0094d/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
