<item><title>Tunis Business School team wins audience award in Turin</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunis-business-school-team-wins-audience-award-in-turin-e0a9d0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunis-business-school-team-wins-audience-award-in-turin-e0a9d0/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The University of Tunis students received the public prize at the seventh UNIMED Start Cup Competition during the Torino Global Skills Summit.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:55:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia sets weekend food discounts, chicken at 7.500 dinars</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-sets-weekend-food-discounts-chicken-at-7-500-dinars-d592ec/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-sets-weekend-food-discounts-chicken-at-7-500-dinars-d592ec/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The 28-29 November offers cover produce and poultry in supermarkets and shops in Kef and Jendouba, with direct sales in two towns.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:53:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
